title: The Good Bit
id: good-bit
tab: Study Hall · The Good Bit
about: Tracker rewinds a tricky dance step and Hertz freezes the glass until they nail the synchronized group jump
lead: tracker
key: F mixolydian
bpm: 108
backing:
bass: none
stage: tracker, hertz
registers: tracker -24, hertz -12
breath: .5
finale: "Go" on 0

tune play = 0 0 2 4 4 5/.5 4/.5 0/1.5 | I 4, IV 4
tune back = 2 2 1 0 1 2/.5 4/.5 0/1.5 | V 4, I 4
tune glass = 4 5 6 5 4 2/.5 3/.5 4/1.5 | VII 4, IV 4
tune wait = 4 4 5 4 2 4/.5 2/.5 0/1.5 | IV 4, I 4
tune step = 0 2 4 5 4 2/.5 1/.5 0/1.5 | I 4, I 4

[rewind]
tracker: "I marked the good bit on the tape" = play ; do laugh ; move left 4 ; cam wide
hertz: "I saw the big jump from the cart" = glass ; do gasp ; move right 4 ; cam two-shot
tracker: "The good bit starts a beat too soon" = back ; do shrug ; take drawer-lead ; cam reaction
hertz: "Then wind it back and press the start" = wait ; do nod ; take crt-answer ; cam closeup

[freeze]
tracker: "Here comes the step we could not do" = play ; do gasp ; move center 4 ; cam wide
hertz: "Hold still! Look right past the glass!" = 4 5 6 5 4/1.5 2/.5 4/1.5 | VII 4, VII 4 ; do nod ; move center 4 ; cam closeup
rest 2
tracker: "The heel lifts first and then the toe" = back ; do laugh ; dance 6 ; cam two-shot
hertz: "That gives the next foot room to trace" = 4 4/.5 5/.5 4/.5 2/.5 4/.5 2/.5 0/3.5 | IV 4, I 4 ; do cheer ; dance 6 ; cam wide
  + tracker @5: "Heel then toe!" = 2/.5 1/.5 0/1.5 ; jump 1.5

[try the step]
hertz: "Let's walk that step right through the reel" = glass ; do laugh ; move left 4 ; cam low-angle
tracker: "You take the step and I will count" = play ; do cheer ; move right 4 ; cam two-shot
hertz: "One heel, then toe, and one heel, then toe!" = 4 5/.5 4/.5 2 4/.5 5/.5 4 2 0/1.5 | IV 4, VII 4 ; do laugh ; dance 8 ; cam wide
  + tracker @4: "One, two, three, four!" = 0 1 2 4 ; dance 4
tracker: "My feet can do what I just saw!" = 0/.5 2/.5 4 5/.5 4/.5 2/.5 1/.5 0/3.5 | I 4, I 4 ; do cheer ; jump 1.5 ; cam low-angle
  + hertz @5: "Watch me hop!" = 4/.5 2/.5 0/1.5 ; jump 1.5

[the good bit]
hertz: "I thought the big jump was the trick" = glass ; do shrug ; move center 4 ; cam closeup
tracker: "The small step lets the whole thing fly!" = 2 2/.5 1/.5 0/.5 1/.5 2/.5 4/.5 0/3.5 | V 4, I 4 ; do cheer ; jump 1.5 ; cam low-angle
  + hertz @5: "Up we fly!" = 2/.5 4/.5 5/1.5 ; jump 1.5
hertz: "We'll leave that bit right on the glass" = 4 4/.5 5/.5 4/.5 2/.5 4/.5 2/.5 0/3.5 | IV 4, I 4 ; do laugh ; move center 4 ; cam two-shot
  + tracker @5: "Keep that frame!" = 2/.5 1/.5 0/1.5
tracker: "One heel, one toe, and off we go!" = 0 2/.5 4/.5 5/.5 4/.5 2/.5 1/.5 0/3.5 | I 4, I 4 ; do bow ; celebrate 6 ; cam wide
  + hertz @5: "Off we go!" = 4/.5 2/.5 2/1.5 ; do bow ; celebrate 4
